<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan buys 33,000 tonnes US barley at tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan buys 33,000 tonnes US barley at tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan Barley Association bought on Friday a shipment of 33,000 tonnes of U.S. barley at a tender from Continental, local traders said.  </p>
<p>The association bought the shipment at US$135 per tonne and freight was fixed at US$16.30 per tonne from MIT, traders said.</p>
<p>The shipment was slated for delivery from October 20 to November 10 from the U.S. Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>--Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
